@startuml
title Supplier Service - Health and Readiness Checks

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Container Orchestrator" as Orchestrator
boundary "Health Router\napp/routes/health.py" as API
control "Alembic Scripts\nmigrations/" as Migrations
database "Supplier Database" as Database

== Liveness ==

Orchestrator -> API: GET /health
activate API
note right of API
  Liveness does not connect to the
  database or inspect migrations.
end note
API --> Orchestrator: 200 OK + healthy
deactivate API

== Readiness ==

Orchestrator -> API: GET /ready
activate API
API -> Migrations: Load packaged migration heads
activate Migrations

alt Migration configuration or scripts are invalid
  Migrations --> API: Inspection fails
  deactivate Migrations
  API --> Orchestrator: 503 Service Unavailable + not_ready
else Packaged heads are valid and nonempty
  Migrations --> API: Packaged heads
  deactivate Migrations
  API -> Database: Connect and SELECT 1
  activate Database

  alt Connection or query fails
    Database --> API: Database unavailable
    API --> Orchestrator: 503 Service Unavailable + not_ready
  else Database responds
    API -> Database: Read installed Alembic heads
    alt Installed heads exactly match packaged heads
      Database --> API: Matching installed heads
      API --> Orchestrator: 200 OK + ready
    else Schema is missing, older, or unexpected
      Database --> API: Nonmatching installed heads
      API --> Orchestrator: 503 Service Unavailable + not_ready
    end
  end
  deactivate Database
end

deactivate API

note over Orchestrator,Database
  Failure responses and logs omit database
  credentials and connection details.
end note

@enduml
